Shared Cluster ID
=================

Generate once:

kafka-storage random-uuid

Example:  MkU3OEVBNTcwNTJENDM2Qk

Use SAME cluster ID everywhere.

5. Format Storage
=================

Controller1:
kafka-storage format -t MkU3OEVBNTcwNTJENDM2Qk -c controller1.properties

Controller2:
kafka-storage format -t MkU3OEVBNTcwNTJENDM2Qk -c controller2.properties

Broker1:
kafka-storage format -t MkU3OEVBNTcwNTJENDM2Qk -c broker1.properties

Broker2:
kafka-storage format -t MkU3OEVBNTcwNTJENDM2Qk -c broker2.properties

6. Start Controllers
====================

Terminal 1:   kafka-server-start controller1.properties

Terminal 2:   kafka-server-start controller2.properties

7. Start Brokers
================

Terminal 3:  kafka-server-start broker1.properties

Terminal 4:  kafka-server-start broker2.properties






